  {
   "rating": 101,
   "date": "2006-09-25T01:23:08-05:00",
   "body": "You do get more of a reward from this than what is listed above.\n\nWithin 24 hours of turning in the texts, you'll get a letter from Ortell in the mail.  Along with a letter, you'll get a package of documents that were supposedly translated from those texts.\n\nThose will vary from decrypted texts that contain news about the Twilight Cultists, buff scrolls, and certain rare plans.  \n\nIn fact, this is the only way to acquire \"Darkrune\" armor plans for blacksmiths, \"Runed Stygian\" armor patterns for tailors, and scrolls to create the \"Crest of Beckonings\" aside from camping out the AH for them.\n\nThis is also a repeatable quest, meaning you can keep turning in stacks of 10 encrypted twilight texts to Ortell instead of to the NPC in Cenarion Hold.  However, while you will get items for the turn ins, you will not get any rep.",
   "replies": [
    "You will get this item in the mail: [item=20469]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "rating": 55,
   "date": "2006-04-28T06:10:47-05:00",
   "body": "When you do this you receive a package in the mail 8 hours later with 2-4 of the following possible rewards:\n\nDecoded Twilight Text - Random twilight letters\nScroll: Create Signet of Beckoning\nScroll: Create Scepter of Beckoning\nScroll: Create Crest of Beckoning\nScroll of Agility IV\nScroll of Protection IV\nPattern: Runed Stygian Belt\nPattern: Runed Stygian Leggings\nPattern: Runed Stygian Boots\nPlans: Darkrune Helm\nPlans: Darkrune Gauntlets\nPlans: Darkrune Breastplate \n\nMost of the time its 2 junk texts which have no use other than reading, a scroll, and a Beckoning item. If you are very lucky you'll get a plan or pattern.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 27,
   "date": "2007-04-21T16:18:07-05:00",
   "body": "You can recieve that quest after finishing https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=8279",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 18,
   "date": "2005-10-12T23:20:18-05:00",
   "body": "I got a pack in the mail along with a letter that reads\n\n\n\"Esteemed <Name>,\n\nI went through the stack of texts you brought me and I decoded the attached articles for you. I carefully selected only those items which I thought would be of use. It was quite problematic to get to a mailbox without being seen, but months of hiding in the desert have turned me into quite a sneak!\"\n\n\nInside the \"Decoded True Believer Clippings\" pack was an agility IV scroll and a \"Decoded Twilight Text\"",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 17,
   "date": "2005-10-27T18:10:47-05:00",
