   "rating": 4,
   "date": "2005-10-27T18:10:47-05:00",
   "body": "At 58 I recieved 6400 experience, this quest can be repeated.&nbsp; Not sure if it tappers or not -- recomend you do faction instead.",
   "replies": [
    "This isn't MEANT to be for rep.&nbsp; Well, it is, but its... weird.\n\nHe mails you stuff that lets you summon a specific templar/duke/lord, as opposed to it being random.&nbsp; This can help you.&nbsp; A fire mage doesn't want to summon a crimson templar and the frost mages don't want an azure one.&nbsp; Certain classes/builds kill certain things better than others.\n\nAlso, for the Tactical quests, you might want to control which one you're summoning.&nbsp; I'm not saying its WORTH this - but it might be if the things you use to control the summon don't get destroyed in the summon (if they do t"
   ]
  },
